  "notes": "One of two further quadruples at n=89 with the same fixed skew first block as n89-eec2e43c042090883c04, the last solution lines of the second slice of the further round of the three-pool join over the cyclic group Z_89. The other three blocks differ from those of every other quadruple at n=89 on the board and have no symmetry. This is a sample and not a census. The Goethals-Seidel matrix of these rows is a skew-Hadamard matrix of order 356."
